    <published>2024-03-07T05:36:00.000Z</published>
    <updated>2024-03-07T05:36:00.000Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>为了思源宋体，做了很多配置，以至于不知道哪个生效了，且作参考吧（。</p><h1><span id="准备font">准备font</span></h1><p>在<code>D:\nodejs\hexo\themes\butterfly\source</code><br>的目录下新建<code>font</code></p><p>因为思源黑体，很难找到TTF格式，所幸有大佬已经做完了，快港声多谢Tiac哥</p><p><a href="https://www.cnblogs.com/tujia/p/15102730.html">思源黑体CN 思源宋体CN TTF 及 字段瘦身 - Tiac - 博客园</a></p><p>还有这几位</p><p><a href="https://www.v2ex.com/t/399030">思源黑体、思源宋体的 TTF 版本 - V2EX</a></p><p>于是把tff放进font</p><h1><span id="写css">写CSS</span></h1><p>在<code>D:\nodejs\hexo\themes\butterfly\source\css/</code>下创建<code>font.css</code>，我感觉这段就没用上</p><figure class="highlight css"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">@font-face</span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">font-family</span>: <span class="string">&#x27;Noto Serif SC&#x27;</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">font-display</span>: swap;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">src</span>: <span class="built_in">url</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;../font/SourceHanSerifCN-Regular.ttf&#x27;</span>) <span class="built_in">format</span>(<span class="string">&quot;truetype&quot;</span>);</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="selector-tag">body</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">font-family</span>: <span class="string">&#x27;JetBrains Mono&#x27;</span>,<span class="string">&#x27;HarmonyOS Sans SC&#x27;</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h1><span id="改varstyle">改var.style</span></h1><p>在<code>D:\nodejs\hexo\themes\butterfly\source\css</code>下修改<code>var.style</code><br>主要修改<code>font-family</code></p><figure class="highlight shell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta prompt_">$</span><span class="language-bash">dafault-font-family = <span class="string">&#x27;Noto Serif SC&#x27;</span>, serif</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
    
