    <title>Git更新hexo博客两次弹出登录框仍然登陆失败</title>
    <link href="https://mifuko.github.io/upblogtoken.html"/>
    <id>https://mifuko.github.io/upblogtoken.html</id>
    <published>2024-03-07T01:07:00.000Z</published>
    <updated>2024-03-07T01:07:00.000Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>更新hexo博客内容，执行<code>hexo g -d</code>报错，弹出两次登录框</p><p><img src="https://s2.loli.net/2024/03/07/kAuMIfUoZqldLtV.png" alt="Pasted image 20240304084319.png"></p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">remote: Support for password authentication was removed on August 13, 2021.</span><br><span class="line">Fatal: Authentication failed for &#x27;https://github.com/mifuko/mifuko.github.io.git/&#x27;</span><br><span class="line">FATAL Something&#x27;s wrong. Maybe you can find the solution here: https://hexo.io/docs/troubleshooting.html</span><br><span class="line">Error: Spawn failed</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>起因是github把password换成了token</p><p>参考<br><a href="https://blog.csdn.net/weixin_41010198/article/details/119698015?utm_source=app&amp;app_version=4.12.0&amp;code=app_1562916241&amp;uLinkId=usr1mkqgl919blen">github开发人员在七夕搞事情：remote: Support for password authentication was removed on August 13, 2021._github remote support for password authentication -CSDN博客</a></p><p>获取自己的token</p><p>打开personal settingg</p><p><img src="https://s2.loli.net/2024/03/07/XeIwN3MmqCO284S.png" alt="Pasted image 20240304085103.png"></p><p>左侧developer settings</p><p><img src="https://s2.loli.net/2024/03/07/Nu2SXEDmG4WiY5F.png" alt="Pasted image 20240304085257.png"></p><p>选<code>Personal access tokens</code>，然后生成<code>Generate new token</code></p><p><img src="https://s2.loli.net/2024/03/07/9EDXlzRJeGISdaP.png" alt="Pasted image 20240304085549.png"></p><p>选择生效时间和权限</p><p><img src="https://s2.loli.net/2024/03/07/lvDkLhpfEWZe4Br.png" alt="Pasted image 20240304085759.png"></p><p><img src="https://s2.loli.net/2024/03/07/A9pxtzkNuVvFCEg.png" alt="Pasted image 20240304085830.png"></p><p>生成后需要复制，不会再看到第二次</p><p><img src="https://s2.loli.net/2024/03/07/utpfIj5Hnv3oNds.png" alt="Pasted image 20240305014915.png"></p><p>重新执行<code>hexo g -d</code>，还是有两次登录框，在密码的地方输入token</p>]]></content>
    
