  <entry>
    <title>hexo升级后用butterfly新主题替换next旧主题</title>
    <link href="https://mifuko.github.io/butterfly2next.html"/>
    <id>https://mifuko.github.io/butterfly2next.html</id>
    <published>2024-03-06T02:59:00.000Z</published>
    <updated>2024-03-06T02:59:00.000Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://s2.loli.net/2024/03/06/PzdmfJxOqZMkS9i.png" alt="Pasted image 20240305054228.png"></p><p>版本太旧于是升级</p><p>当前版本如下</p><p><img src="https://s2.loli.net/2024/03/06/dLGmeFpgJiYwncK.png" alt="Pasted image 20240305054304.png"></p><p>升级之后版本如下</p><p><img src="https://s2.loli.net/2024/03/06/4dwZJcCjy8Ssumx.png" alt="Pasted image 20240305054545.png"></p><p>查看过期的包</p><p><img src="https://s2.loli.net/2024/03/06/hrzLb1DI9pPJUqS.png" alt="Pasted image 20240305061218.png"></p><p>修改<code>package.json</code><br>升级<code>npm install --save</code></p><p>升级后查看版本报错<br><code>TypeError: Cannot read property &#39;length&#39; of undefined</code></p><p><img src="https://s2.loli.net/2024/03/06/dW5gy84XMutzbrh.png" alt="Pasted image 20240305061436.png"></p><p>使用这段后</p><figure class="highlight shell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta prompt_"># </span><span class="language-bash">进入博客的根目录</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta prompt_">$ </span><span class="language-bash"><span class="built_in">cd</span> /blog-root</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta prompt_"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta prompt_"># </span><span class="language-bash">删除package-lock.json</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta prompt_"># </span><span class="language-bash"><span class="built_in">rm</span> -rf package-lock.json</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta prompt_"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta prompt_"># </span><span class="language-bash">更新package.json</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta prompt_">$ </span><span class="language-bash">npm -upgrade</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta prompt_"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta prompt_"># </span><span class="language-bash">删除整个模块目录，这样可以避免很多坑</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta prompt_">$ </span><span class="language-bash"><span class="built_in">rm</span> -rf node_modules</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta prompt_"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta prompt_"># </span><span class="language-bash">更新Hexo的模块</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta prompt_">$ </span><span class="language-bash">npm update --save</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta prompt_"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta prompt_"># </span><span class="language-bash">或者强制更新 没有用上</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta prompt_">$ </span><span class="language-bash">npm update --save --force</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>此时再查看版本，权当成功了吧（。</p><p><img src="https://s2.loli.net/2024/03/06/lLE6ptrD4uWVYTZ.png" alt="Pasted image 20240305062121.png"></p><p>继续安装butterfly</p><p><img src="https://s2.loli.net/2024/03/06/jbyRe9LlMv8pzTo.png" alt="Pasted image 20240305055953.png"></p><p><a href="https://blog.csdn.net/tombosky/article/details/135835362#3.%20%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B">npm ERR! code CERT_HAS_EXPIRED：解决证书过期问题的详细步骤-CSDN博客</a></p><p>npm install 安装慢<br><a href="https://blog.csdn.net/mmklo/article/details/125486612">解决npm install 安装慢！！！_npm 太慢-CSDN博客</a></p><p>换成淘宝源，报错</p><p><a href="https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/683192771">npm 报错 request to https://registry.npm.taobao.org/three failed, reason: certificate has expired - 知乎</a></p><p>解决</p><p><a href="https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/683192771">npm 报错 request to https://registry.npm.taobao.org/three failed, reason: certificate has expired - 知乎</a></p><p>主题替换上之后，报错<br><code>TypeError: __permalink.startsWith is not a function</code></p><p><img src="https://s2.loli.net/2024/03/06/3OjG6WpdTZNnqmK.png" alt="Pasted image 20240305062936.png"></p><p>大佬的解决方案，大概意思就是先clone了主题，但是再去搞hexo的升级，就会出现不兼容，在顺序上需要先升级完成，包括hexo和node的升级，再去clone需要的主题</p><p><a href="https://cloud.tencent.com/developer/article/2388627">Hexo升级之后Butterfly主题不兼容，发生报错：TypeError: require(…) is not a function-腾讯云开发者社区-腾讯云</a></p><p>仍然不解决，查询其他报错<br><code>WARN  Deprecated config detected: &quot;use_date_for_updated&quot; i</code></p><p>大佬的解决方案，是从4升到5，我是从4升到了6，完美解决warning和报错<br><a href="https://github.com/next-theme/hexo-theme-next/issues/104">新版本部署报错 · Issue #104 · next-theme/hexo-theme-next · GitHub</a><br><a href="https://cyfeng.science/2020/11/20/hexo-use-date-for-updated-warning-solution/">HEXO 新版本 ‘use_date_for_updated’ 警告的解决方法 | CO + 2Fe = COFFee</a></p><p>打开根目录下的 <code>_config.yml</code> 找到 <code>use_date_for_updated: false</code> ，改为：<br><code>updated_option: &#39;date&#39;</code>: 使用 date 作为 updated 的值。可被用于 Git 工作流之中，因为使用 Git 管理站点时，文件的最后修改日期常常会发生改变<br><code>updated_option: &#39;mtime&#39;</code>: 使用文件的最后修改时间。这是从 Hexo 3.0.0 开始的默认行为。<br><code>updated_option: &#39;empty&#39;</code>: 直接删除 updated。使用这一选项可能会导致大部分主题和插件无法正常工作。</p><p>现在的问题剩下，只有一篇文章最新的一篇，而不是历史文章都在</p><p><img src="https://s2.loli.net/2024/03/06/qtXoODCuYdBTrk3.png" alt="Pasted image 20240305063740.png"></p><p>尝试把<code>_post</code>里面的全部挪走清空，报错<br><code>Unable to call the return value of (posts[&quot;first&quot;])[&quot;updated&quot;][&quot;toISOString&quot;], which is undefined or falsey</code></p><p><img src="https://s2.loli.net/2024/03/06/Tn7QhOYjB2PvKRe.png" alt="Pasted image 20240305064747.png"></p><p>于是再删除<code>.deploy_git</code>文件夹，报错<br><code>Template render error: (unknown path) [Line 8, Column 25]</code></p><p><img src="https://s2.loli.net/2024/03/06/CbROmKJ9jvr1x4Z.png" alt="Pasted image 20240305065011.png"></p><p>尝试切换版本，无果</p><p><a href="https://blog.csdn.net/birdfly2015/article/details/104216232">Hexo之next主题配置时ERROR Template render error_templaterenderpolicy render error-CSDN博客</a></p><p><img src="https://s2.loli.net/2024/03/06/UHNXJlKZndDCutV.png" alt="Pasted image 20240305070317.png"></p><p>把<code>_post</code>整个文件夹删掉，使用这里的方法clone主题，再来一次</p><p><a href="https://cloud.tencent.com/developer/article/1935545">Butterfly主题的安装及更新-腾讯云开发者社区-腾讯云</a></p><p>重新新建<code>_post</code>文件夹，依然无法解决</p><p>看来看去都是md中有无法转码导致崩溃，但是我已经删完了还是不行</p><p>最后尝试拷贝了一个纯中文的md文件，放到<code>_post</code>下，<code>hexo -g</code>就没报错了……大崩溃……<br>实际显示地址还是这个</p><p><a href="http://localhost:4000/">http://localhost:4000/</a></p><p><img src="https://s2.loli.net/2024/03/06/ZYCKgBl83WtbP6j.png" alt="Pasted image 20240305074525.png"><br><img src="https://s2.loli.net/2024/03/06/YjELkD4G1cTH6SC.png" alt="Pasted image 20240305074723.png"></p><p>最后再来一波<br><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo clean</span><br><span class="line">hexo g -d</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><br>乞丐版发布成功</p><p><img src="https://s2.loli.net/2024/03/06/rT6GZQzuR5UOW9P.png" alt="Pasted image 20240305075002.png"></p><p>美化折腾看这篇</p><p>占个座</p>]]></content>
    
